# Local-first workflow

Agents infer lane, branch, and done-when from this rule. Do **not** ask Shawn to paste an intake checklist.

## Silent intake (every coding chat)

At the start of work, fill silently (do not ask Shawn to paste):

| Field | How to decide |
|-------|----------------|
| **Lane** | `ops` = live Fly `/data` only, no git. `code` = feature branch → localhost → PR → merge `main`. |
| **Surface** | `school/` `it/` `staff/` `student/` `class/` `mgs/` from what is changing. |
| **Branch** | Match surface prefix; never commit on `main` for feature work. |
| **Local done-when** | UI/route work must pass at `http://127.0.0.1:8787` (not screenshot-only). |
| **Ops vs code** | Ops never invents git commits; code never `flyctl deploy`s for routine release. |

Point at existing school rules (`elc-school`, `semester-awareness`, `repo-conventions`) for teaching constants — do not duplicate semester facts here.

## Two lanes

- **ops** — no git. Live volume `/data` on Fly (`https://alc.mckenzian.com`). Semester/staff/pack actions on production data only when Shawn explicitly confirms live DB.
- **code** — feature branch → localhost verify → PR → CI → merge `main` → Actions deploy.

## Release truth

- Push/merge to **`main`** deploys ([`.github/workflows/deploy.yml`](.github/workflows/deploy.yml)).
- Other branches run tests only ([`.github/workflows/ci.yml`](.github/workflows/ci.yml)).
- Routine release = merge to `main` and watch Deploy + `/health`. Do **not** run laptop `flyctl deploy` unless Shawn explicitly asks.

## Forbidden unless Shawn asks

- `flyctl deploy` / `fly deploy`
- Push to `main`
- Commit secrets, `.imscc`, or `lms/data/`
- Any git commit (repo rule: only commit when Shawn asks)

## Branch prefixes

| Prefix | Use |
|--------|-----|
| `school/` | Shared frameworks, agent rules/skills, cross-cutting school docs |
| `it/` | IT portal / admin tooling |
| `staff/` | Staff LMS UI/API (including Attendance & Participation / Grades) |
| `student/` | Student portal |
| `class/` | Class/section offering wiring |
| `mgs/` | Game-show package only when detached from staff shell |

## Localhost gate

UI, route, or staff/student portal work is **unfinished** until exercised at `http://127.0.0.1:8787`. Screenshot-only or “looks right in template” is not done. Use `.cursor/skills/local-verify` and `.cursor/skills/release-gate` when relevant.
